# Morrowind Temple: Uvoo Llaren's first two duties at Ghostgate. "Ministry of Truth to the Heathen"
# (TT_MinistryHeathen): "Assantus Hansar" (10, enables him outside Ghostgate). Curing his Droops trips his
# assantusScript (GetCommonDisease == 0, 50), and Uvoo Llaren rewards it (100). "Supply the Monk" (TT_SupplyMonk):
# "food and drink" (10, four kwama eggs and four Mazte). Sendus Sathis on Shuran Island takes them (Choice 1, 50),
# and Uvoo Llaren thanks the player (100).
# The console cast of Cure Common Disease on Other (0590EB09) stands in for the player casting it, Position and
# PositionCell for the travel. Ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05: 0529FF8B Assantus Hansar.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_advancement --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_ministry_start
run
player->PositionCell 71 303 -510 0 "Ghostgate, Temple"
until 600 "uvoo llaren"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk uvoo llaren
ask duties
ask Assantus Hansar
expect GetJournalIndex TT_MinistryHeathen == 10
bye
end

case tt_ministry_cure
run
player->Position 21774 34800 1958 0
until 600 "assantushansar"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
console player.cast 0590EB09 0529FF8B right
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_MinistryHeathen == 50
end

case tt_ministry_done
run
player->PositionCell 71 303 -510 0 "Ghostgate, Temple"
until 600 "uvoo llaren"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk uvoo llaren
ask Assantus Hansar
expect GetJournalIndex TT_MinistryHeathen == 100
ask duties
ask food and drink
expect GetJournalIndex TT_SupplyMonk == 10
bye
end

case tt_supply_deliver
run
player->Position 39815 154250 929 0
until 600 "sendus sathis"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk sendus sathis
ask food and drink
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TT_SupplyMonk == 50
bye
end

case tt_supply_done
run
player->PositionCell 71 303 -510 0 "Ghostgate, Temple"
until 600 "uvoo llaren"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk uvoo llaren
ask food and drink
expect GetJournalIndex TT_SupplyMonk == 100
bye
end
